msgstr "This is the mission board. The main story is the road ahead of us."

msgid "TUTORIAL_SORTIE_STORY_1_R"
msgstr "What's the first stage?"

msgid "TUTORIAL_SORTIE_STORY_2"
msgstr "Stage 1-1: the Ashen Valley. My sensors picked up an ancient stone golem waking up there."

msgid "TUTORIAL_SORTIE_STORY_2_R"
msgstr "That doesn't sound good."

msgid "TUTORIAL_STAGE_PREPARE_1"
msgstr "Each stage has three bonus objectives that pay extra gold. For now, just focus on clearing it."

msgid "TUTORIAL_STAGE_PREPARE_1_R"
msgstr "Got it."

msgid "TUTORIAL_STAGE_PREPARE_2"
msgstr "Good news: clear it once and Kazeyumi joins the team. Plus a First Recruitment Ticket."

msgid "TUTORIAL_STAGE_PREPARE_2_R"
msgstr "Worth a shot!"

msgid "TUTORIAL_PARTY_GO_1"
msgstr "Right now the team is just Enkiba. One fighter, but a tough one."

msgid "TUTORIAL_PARTY_GO_1_R"
msgstr "Is one enough?"

msgid "TUTORIAL_PARTY_GO_2"
msgstr "Enough, I ran the numbers. The golem always winds up before a slam, so dodge when you see it."

msgid "TUTORIAL_PARTY_GO_2_R"
msgstr "Noted."

msgid "TUTORIAL_RETRY_1"
msgstr "It's okay, everyone stumbles the first time. I've saved the data from that fight."

msgid "TUTORIAL_RETRY_1_R"
msgstr "Let's try again."

msgid "TUTORIAL_RESULT_HUB_1"
msgstr "Victory! The golem has stopped. Logging your performance, Manager: very impressive."

msgid "TUTORIAL_RESULT_HUB_1_R"
msgstr "Thanks, NEO."

msgid "TUTORIAL_RESULT_HUB_2"
msgstr "Kazeyumi has joined the team, and there's a First Recruitment Ticket in your bag."

msgid "TUTORIAL_RESULT_HUB_2_R"
msgstr "How do I use it?"

msgid "TUTORIAL_HUB_SUPPLY_1"
msgstr "Welcome back to the lobby. Recruitment tickets are used in the Supply area."

msgid "TUTORIAL_HUB_SUPPLY_1_R"
msgstr "Let's go."

