msgid "TUTORIAL_RECRUIT_STARTER_1_R"
msgstr "What's special about it?"

msgid "TUTORIAL_RECRUIT_STARTER_2"
msgstr "Raikiba is guaranteed in those ten. Raikiba's speed will round out the team nicely."

msgid "TUTORIAL_RECRUIT_STARTER_2_R"
msgstr "Let's pull!"

msgid "TUTORIAL_RECRUIT_DONE_1"
msgstr "Raikiba has joined! The team is complete: Enkiba, Kazeyumi, Raikiba."

msgid "TUTORIAL_RECRUIT_DONE_1_R"
msgstr "Awesome!"

msgid "TUTORIAL_RECRUIT_DONE_2"
msgstr "Quick tip: in battle, when a reserve portrait glows, switch to them to trigger an elemental reaction."

msgid "TUTORIAL_RECRUIT_DONE_2_R"
msgstr "I'll remember."

