msgid "BARK_CH01_START"
msgstr "We're inside the Hollow Zone. I'm watching from inside the Neo, go ahead, Manager."

msgid "BARK_CH01_WAVE1"
msgstr "Ash dregs in the way. Clear them and we move on."

msgid "BARK_CH01_WAVE1_NEO"
msgstr "Ash dregs are blocking the road. Clear them out first."

msgid "BARK_CH01_CP1"
msgstr "When the fire underground dies, the rock cracks. Watch the sinkholes."

msgid "BARK_CH01_CP1_NEO"
msgstr "The ground caved in once the fire below died. Careful with the gaps."

msgid "BARK_CH01_WAVE2"
msgstr "More of them now. Switch me in, my wind can slow them down."

msgid "BARK_CH01_WAVE2_NEO"
msgstr "More of them this time. Hitting from range or slowing them helps."

msgid "BARK_CH01_CP2"
msgstr "I can see the furnace gate! Bigger than I thought."

msgid "BARK_CH01_CP2_NEO"
msgstr "The Mother Hearth's gate is just ahead."

msgid "BARK_CH01_CP3"
msgstr "The guardian is right ahead. This is the last anchor point, you're covered."

msgid "BARK_CH01_BOSS"
msgstr "Guardian! We're on the Hearth's side, stop!"

msgid "BARK_CH01_BOSS_NEO"
msgstr "The Ancient Stone Golem! It no longer answers to the valley."

msgid "BARK_CH01_BOSS_B"
msgstr "No response. Its ground slam has a long wind-up, dodge when you see it."

msgid "BARK_CH01_PHASE2"
msgstr "There's a channel signal in the guardian's core... It isn't mine."

msgid "BARK_CH01_PHASE2_B"
msgstr "Someone woke it up on purpose?!"

msgid "BARK_CH01_PHASE2_B_NEO"
msgstr "Someone woke it up on purpose."

msgid "BARK_CH01_QUAKE"
msgstr "It slams out shockwaves both ways, jump over them!"

msgid "BARK_CH01_QUAKE_NEO"
msgstr "Shockwaves both ways! Jump to avoid them."

msgid "NEO_HINT_SKILL"
msgstr "Energy is full! Try your skill (%s)."

msgid "NEO_HINT_WEAPON"
msgstr "Weapon skill ready (%s). It hits hard."

msgid "NEO_HINT_ULTIMATE"
msgstr "Ultimate gauge is full! Let it all out (%s)."

msgid "NEO_HINT_DODGE"
msgstr "Dodge (%s) right before a hit lands for a perfect dodge: enemies slow down."

msgid "NEO_HINT_HOLD"
msgstr "Tip: hold %s to charge a stronger strike."

msgid "NEO_HINT_STUN"
msgstr "The enemy is about to be Stunned! Land a few more heavy hits."

msgid "NEO_HINT_LINK"
msgstr "A reserve portrait is glowing! Switch now to trigger an elemental reaction."

msgid "NEO_HINT_REACTION"
msgstr "Elemental reaction! That's perfect switch timing, Manager."

msgid "STORY_CH01_OPEN_SUMMARY"
msgstr "The Ancient Stone Golem at the end of the Ashen Valley is devouring the Mother Hearth's fire. Cross the valley and stop it before the fire dies out."

msgid "STORY_CH01_OPEN_01_1"
msgstr "The Ashen Valley."

msgid "STORY_CH01_OPEN_02_1"
msgstr "We're here! …Huh. Why is it so quiet?"

msgid "STORY_CH01_OPEN_03_1"
msgstr "No wind at all. The ash falls straight down, like inside a closed room."

msgid "STORY_CH01_OPEN_04_1"
msgstr "The Mother Hearth is at the end of this road."

msgid "STORY_CH01_OPEN_05_1"
msgstr "This is your hometown? You talked about it all the time back at the Fang Forge."

msgid "STORY_CH01_OPEN_06_1"
msgstr "Yeah. The fires here used to burn higher than the rooftops. Now… just look."

msgid "STORY_CH01_OPEN_07_1"
msgstr "Hollow Zone boundary detected. Elemental density ahead is down to 12%."

msgid "STORY_CH01_OPEN_08_1"
msgstr "Enough to sustain one suit. Not three."

msgid "STORY_CH01_OPEN_08_2"
msgstr "So it's like the manual said? I… only skimmed it."

msgid "STORY_CH01_OPEN_09_1"
msgstr "One of us takes the field, two wait in Neo's channel. The Manager decides who goes out."

msgid "STORY_CH01_OPEN_09_2"
msgstr "When someone's channel resonates, I'll signal. Switch right then and two elements collide."

msgid "STORY_CH01_OPEN_09_3"
msgstr "And then boom! That part I remember."

msgid "STORY_CH01_OPEN_10_1"
msgstr "Large signal at the end of the valley. A stone guardian… it's draining the elements around it."

msgid "STORY_CH01_OPEN_10_2"
msgstr "The Ancient Stone Golem…? It's guarded the Hearth for a hundred years and never moved."

msgid "STORY_CH01_OPEN_11_1"
msgstr "Fire doesn't die this fast on its own. It's swallowing what's left."

msgid "STORY_CH01_OPEN_12_1"
msgstr "And what are those hopping lumps of ash?"

msgid "STORY_CH01_OPEN_12_2"
msgstr "Dregs. Leftover elements clumped together. The golem pulls them in, and they block the road."

msgid "STORY_CH01_OPEN_13_1"
msgstr "Manager. If the Hearth goes out, the Hollow Zone swallows my village. Send us in."

msgid "STORY_CH01_OPEN_14_1"
msgstr "Objective logged. Awaiting the Manager's order to deploy."

msgid "STORY_CH01_OPEN_15_1"
msgstr "Call me when you need speed."

msgid "STORY_CH01_OPEN_15_2"
msgstr "And a reminder from me: don't take too many hits."

msgid "STORY_CH01_OPEN_CARD_TITLE"
msgstr "Chapter 1 — The Ashen Valley"

msgid "STORY_CH01_OPEN_CARD_SUB"
msgstr "Objective: cross the valley and stop the Ancient Stone Golem before the Hearth dies out."

msgid "STORY_CH01_END_SUMMARY"
msgstr "The Mother Hearth burns again and the village is safe. Inside the golem's core lies a channel seal coded 00: there is another Neo, and its holder woke the guardian. The trail leads to the Guardian Highlands."

msgid "STORY_CH01_END_01_1"
msgstr "The Hollow Zone has thinned. Opening the channel: everyone can come out."

msgid "STORY_CH01_END_02_1"
msgstr "Phew… That thing was huge."

msgid "STORY_CH01_END_03_1"
msgstr "It wasn't evil. It was forced awake and made to stand guard alone, with no one to relieve it."

msgid "STORY_CH01_END_04_1"
msgstr "The Hearth is still cold."

msgid "STORY_CH01_END_04_2"
msgstr "The guardian has stopped draining. Elemental density: 12%… 19%… 31%."

msgid "STORY_CH01_END_05_1"
msgstr "Wake up. It's your turn now."

msgid "STORY_CH01_END_06_1"
msgstr "…It's burning."

msgid "STORY_CH01_END_06_2"
msgstr "It's burning! It's really burning!"

msgid "STORY_CH01_END_07_1"
msgstr "The wind is back too. Listen."

msgid "STORY_CH01_END_07_2"
msgstr "The Hollow Zone boundary has receded 2 km. Coalhearth Village is safe."

msgid "STORY_CH01_END_08_1"
msgstr "What's this? It looks a lot like Neo's ring."

msgid "STORY_CH01_END_09_1"
msgstr "A channel seal fragment… same format as mine. Device code: 00."

msgid "STORY_CH01_END_09_2"
msgstr "Our Neo isn't number 00."

msgid "STORY_CH01_END_10_1"
msgstr "So there's another Neo. And whoever holds it woke my village's guardian."

msgid "STORY_CH01_END_11_1"
msgstr "I've seen this mark on maps. The guardian workshop up on the stone highlands."

msgid "STORY_CH01_END_11_2"
msgstr "Anyone who wanted to wake them must have gone there first."

msgid "STORY_CH01_END_12_1"
msgstr "Heading out right away? My legs are still warmed up."

msgid "STORY_CH01_END_13_1"
msgstr "Let's go. The Hearth burns again. I won't let anywhere else go dark like this."

msgid "STORY_CH01_END_13_2"
msgstr "Coordinates logged: the Guardian Highlands. Awaiting the Manager's orders."

msgid "STORY_CH01_END_14_1"
msgstr "One watch left unfinished. No matter. There are many more guardians."

msgid "STORY_CH01_END_CARD_TITLE"
msgstr "Chapter 1 — Complete"

msgid "STORY_CH01_END_CARD_SUB"
msgstr "Chapter 2: The Sleeping Stone Workshop — coming soon"

